cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these derived data, please cite both the manuscript and the archived release."
title: "VTA-NAcc resting-state coupling shows no detectable age effect across the lifespan: analysis code and derived data"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and derived subject-level data for a replication of the Murty et al. (2018)
  resting-state VTA-NAcc null finding, in 307 participants aged 9-83 from the NKI-Rockland
  sample. Reproduces every statistic reported in the manuscript without downloading imaging data.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Hu
    given-names: Xiaowei
    orcid: "0009-0003-0567-192X"
repository-code: "https://github.com/David19870820/vta-nacc-lifespan"
keywords:
  - resting-state fMRI
  - functional connectivity
  - ventral tegmental area
  - nucleus accumbens
  - replication
  - null results
  - head motion
  - NKI-Rockland
